sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Owner
  participant Agent
  participant Board
  participant Signer as Signing window
  Agent->>Board: put /orders/evals (draft)
  Agent->>Board: request_signature(path)
  Board-->>Owner: Show "Review order" button
  Owner->>Signer: Open order
  activate Signer
  alt Owner approves
    Signer->>Owner: Ask for Touch ID
    Owner-->>Signer: Fingerprint
    Signer->>Board: Write signature
    Board-->>Agent: Order signed
  else Owner requests changes
    Signer->>Board: Write change request
    Board-->>Agent: Changes requested
    Agent->>Board: put revised draft
  end
  deactivate Signer
  loop Every session start
    Agent->>Board: attention.verify
    Board-->>Agent: Valid until expiry
  end
  Note over Agent,Board: The order binds the agent until it expires
